OL,3,GNEWSASchoolgirls to represent England
OL,4,Aat world cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn under-18s girls' football team will
OL,7,Frepresent England in a schools world
OL,8,Fcup taking place in China.
OL,10,FThe team from Parkstone Grammar School,
OL,11,Fnear Poole, Dorset, will head to Suzhou
OL,12,Ffor the International School Sport
OL,13,FFederation (ISF) World Cup 2026, which
OL,14,Fgets under way on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe squad was selected after reaching
OL,17,Fthe semi-finals of a national schools
OL,18,Ftournament, and will play six matches
OL,19,Fagainst teams that could include
OL,20,Fschools from Brazil, Morocco, Germany
OL,21,Fand France.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
