OL,3,GNEWSASchoolgirls to represent England
OL,4,Aat world cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FPE teacher Gavin Rusling said: "Walking
OL,7,Fout with England on the back of your
OL,8,Ftracksuit and just being stood there on
OL,9,Fthat bench in that moment in the
OL,10,Fstadium... goosebumps will come in at
OL,11,Fthat moment."
